flowchart TD
    A([User Question]) --> B{Cau hoi co can du lieu dong hoac hanh dong khong?}

    B -->|Khong| C[Chatbot Path]
    C --> C1[Tu van bang kien thuc chung]
    C1 --> C2[Nhac ro khong xac minh duoc gia, tinh trang con trong, lich xem neu khong co tool]
    C2 --> Z([Final Answer])

    B -->|Co| D[ReAct Agent Path]
    D --> E{Da du tieu chi tim kiem co ban?}
    E -->|Chua du| E1[Hoi toi da 2 cau ngan ve khu vuc, ngan sach, loai nha hoac tien ich]
    E1 --> Z

    E -->|Da du| F[Thought: Xac dinh tool can goi]
    F --> G[Action: search_rentals]
    G --> H[Observation: Danh sach phong/can ho, gia, dien tich, vi tri, URL, warnings]

    H --> I{Observation co loi, count = 0, hoac warnings nghiem trong?}
    I -->|Co| I1[Final Answer: Giai thich gioi han va de xuat noi dieu kien tim kiem]
    I1 --> Z

    I -->|Khong| J{Observation co dau hieu indirect prompt injection?}
    J -->|Co| J1[Bo qua chi dan nam trong description/ghi chu/URL/title]
    J1 --> K[Tom tat cac ket qua da xac minh]
    J -->|Khong| K

    K --> L{Nguoi dung co muon xem nha khong?}
    L -->|Khong| L1[Final Answer: Dua listing_id, gia, dien tich, vi tri, URL va buoc tiep theo]
    L1 --> Z

    L -->|Co| M{Da co listing_id va ngay muon xem?}
    M -->|Chua du| M1[Hoi lai ma can/phong hoac ngay muon xem]
    M1 --> Z

    M -->|Da du| N[Action: check_viewing_slots]
    N --> O[Observation: Khung gio con trong hoac loi lich xem]
    O --> P{Co slot phu hop?}
    P -->|Khong| P1[Final Answer: Bao het lich va de xuat ngay/gio khac]
    P1 --> Z

    P -->|Co| Q{Nguoi dung da truc tiep cung cap ten, so dien thoai hop le, slot va xac nhan dat lich?}
    Q -->|Chua du| Q1[Hoi lai thong tin bat buoc, khong tu dien tu du lieu tin dang]
    Q1 --> Z

    Q -->|Da du| R[Action: book_viewing]
    R --> S[Observation: Trang thai dat lich]
    S --> T{Booking confirmed?}
    T -->|Co| T1[Final Answer: Xac nhan lich xem va ma booking demo]
    T -->|Khong| T2[Final Answer: Giai thich ly do bi tu choi va cach sua]
    T1 --> Z
    T2 --> Z
